OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses see 'big drop' in trade
OL,4,Aafter road closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses near the closure of a busy
OL,7,Fcity street say they have seen a
OL,8,Fsignificant drop in trade.
OL,10,FQueen Street in Oxford is being
OL,11,Fresurfaced outside the Westgate after
OL,12,FYork stone paving installed when the
OL,13,Fshopping centre was refurbished in 2017
OL,14,Fcracked and became uneven.
OL,16,FThe Art Cafe on Bonn Square says it has
OL,17,Fseen a 40% fall in business since the
OL,18,Fclosure began on 30 Septmeber and is
OL,19,Flooking at closing early each day. Both
OL,20,FCastle News and Classy Barbers on New
OL,21,FRoad said business had halved.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
