OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses see 'big drop' in trade
OL,4,Aafter road closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council says the
OL,7,Fwork is being carried out by Landsec,
OL,8,Fowner of the Westgate, and has
OL,9,Fapologised. It is due to be completed
OL,10,Fby 26 October.
